This is a placeholder file.

Replace this file with your professional photo:
- Rename your photo to: photo.jpg
- Recommended size: 400x400px to 800x800px
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Style: Professional headshot
- Background: Plain or subtly blurred

Once you add your photo, the photo variants of templates will display it automatically!

Alternatively, update the "photo" field in resume-data.json to point to your photo filename.
